  "结清最后一期水电气网账单，确认没有新费用": "Settle the final utility and internet bills; confirm no new charges", "确认贷款结清、escrow 退款到账": "Confirm the mortgage payoff and escrow refund",
  "按租约书面通知房东（通常提前 30–60 天）": "Give the landlord written notice per the lease (usually 30–60 days)", "安防、清洁等服务：通知停止": "Alarm, cleaning and similar services: stop", "网络：预约停机或迁到新地址；归还设备": "Internet: schedule disconnect or transfer; return equipment",
  "电：预约退租日停止服务与最终抄表": "Electric: schedule stop service and final read for move-out day", "燃气：预约退租日最终抄表并关户": "Gas: schedule the final read and close the account on move-out day", "水 / 垃圾：销户或转回房东": "Water / trash: close the account or transfer back to the landlord",
  "租客保险：改地址或取消": "Renter's insurance: update the address or cancel", "清洁、修补、拍照录像留证": "Clean, patch, and document with photos and video", "交钥匙、抄表读数、签退租确认": "Return keys, record meter readings, sign the move-out confirmation",
  "取消房租和剩余自动扣款": "Cancel rent and remaining autopays", "押金退还（伊州 30–45 天内），未退或扣款不合理可追讨": "Security deposit return (Illinois: within 30–45 days); dispute unreasonable deductions",

